doc:FactsMcsaDesign None:has_text_value "Limitations: SE energy averaging cannot effectively separate impulsive fault transients from smooth structural modulations; dominant mesh harmonics can overshadow fault-induced impacts; TSA and residual averaging may further attenuate weak non-repetitive transients; narrowband SE fails to capture broadband or drifting impulsive energy" .
